### Liste JSON
GET http://localhost:8082/banque/comptes
Accept: application/json

### Liste XML
GET http://localhost:8082/banque/comptes
Accept: application/xml

### Détail
GET http://localhost:8082/banque/comptes/1
Accept: application/json

### Création JSON
POST http://localhost:8082/banque/comptes
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"solde":1200,"dateCreation":"2026-11-03","type":"COURANT"}

### Création XML
POST http://localhost:8082/banque/comptes
Content-Type: application/xml
Accept: application/xml

<compte><solde>3500</solde><dateCreation>2026-11-03</dateCreation><type>EPARGNE</type></compte>

### Modification JSON
PUT http://localhost:8082/banque/comptes/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"solde":2500,"dateCreation":"2026-11-03","type":"EPARGNE"}

### Modification XML
PUT http://localhost:8082/banque/comptes/1
Content-Type: application/xml
Accept: application/xml

<compte><solde>4200</solde><dateCreation>2026-11-03</dateCreation><type>COURANT</type></compte>

### Suppression (utiliser l'ID créé)
DELETE http://localhost:8082/banque/comptes/4

### Compte inexistant
GET http://localhost:8082/banque/comptes/999999
Accept: application/json
